            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The infiltration test has shown air leakage from the following house components:

- Receptacles

- Some windows (Living room, wood window)

- Rear door

- Bathroom fan

- Furnace (cap missing) 



During the infiltration test walkthrough, we notice air leakage on the items listed above. Airtightness is the key to energy saving.

</airSeal>
                <ceilings>At the time of the audit, the attic insulation inspection was not possible. We estimated the insulation level to be R-30. We recommend the addition of insulation to meet the city of Whitehorse standard of R-60. </ceilings>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
